EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §4.2, DECISIONS 312: neither generator has a type for a map of optional values, so it is OptionalMapValue wherever it is, read by a data loader or not (a map a loader cannot read is MapField alone, E8019_99).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A row.
record Row {
  /// The cells.
  cells: {String: Int?}
}

/// Held by no value.
record Loose {
  /// The cells.
  cells: {String: Int?}
}

/// The rows.
let rows: table Row = {
  one { cells: {"a": 1} }
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- a.rows.json --
{"one": {"cells": {"a": 1}}}
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:6:3
  emit go in data mode cannot generate a map with optional values; leave absent entries out of the map

error[E8019]  a/a.canon:12:3
  emit go in data mode cannot generate a map with optional values; leave absent entries out of the map

